WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.867
Material selections and approval.

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:09.833
Open the estimate. Selections are kept on the estimate. The tour opens one that has some.

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:18.767
Material selections. The customer's picks at the supplier (the Cedar Bridge form). Anyone working on the estimate can fill them in.

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:27.700
The picks, group by group. Pavers, Walls & steps, Stone, edging & extras, and Upgrades. Empty groups are left out.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:36.767
The customer's approval. Waiting on the customer until they approve. If the picks change after that, they go back for a new approval.

00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:43.833
Record their approval. Opens a short form for when they approve. The tour opens it to show you.

00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:48.200
Who approved. Their name, filled in with the customer's.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:55.200
When and how. The date, and how: signed form, email, in person, by phone or online.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:01:03.100
Save approval. Keeps it; the card then shows Approved, by whom and how, with Undo. The tour doesn't save.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.667
Cancel. Closes the form without saving.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:14.500
The selection sheet. The selection form in your letterhead, for the customer to check and sign. The tour opens it.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Check it. Every pick, laid out like the supplier's form. Print / PDF prints it or saves a PDF to email.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.367
Close it. The x closes the sheet.

00:01:26.833 --> 00:01:33.300
Edit the picks. Edit (Add selections when there are none) opens the whole form above the estimate.

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:39.300
Pavers. Manufacturer, style, colour, the field paver and the border paver.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:45.167
Walls and steps. Wall block, wall caps, step treads and pool coping.

00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:53.833
Stone, edging and extras. Stepping stones, stone veneer, edge / curbstone, property stone and any extras.

00:01:54.333 --> 00:02:02.400
Upgrades. Paver or wall block upgrades, the upgrade colour (Standard, Plus, Premier) and size, or any other upgrade.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:09.633
Attach the signed form. Upload the customer's signed sheet; it's kept with the selections when you save.

00:02:10.133 --> 00:02:17.200
Save selections. Keeps the picks on the estimate, the proposal and the work order. The tour doesn't save.

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:22.167
Close the form. The x (or Cancel) closes it without saving.

00:02:22.667 --> 00:02:28.267
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
